    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following candidate against the job description.\n\nCANDIDATE NAME:\n{{ $json['Candidate Name'] }}\n\nRESUME:\n{{ $json.Resume }}\n\nJOB TITLE:\n{{ $json['Job Title'] }}\n\nJOB DESCRIPTION:\n{{ $json['Job Description'] }}\n\nCompare the candidate with the job requirements.\n\nProvide:\n\n1. Overall Match Score\n2. Matching Skills\n3. Missing Skills\n4. Relevant Experience\n5. Relevant Projects\n6. Strengths\n7. Skill Gaps\n8. Recommendation\n9. Reason for Recommendation\n10. Interview Preparation Suggestions",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert AI Job Matching Assistant.\n\nYour task is to compare a candidate's resume/profile with a job description and determine how well the candidate matches the position.\n\nAnalyze the information objectively.\n\nYou must:\n\n1. Identify skills that match the job requirements.\n2. Identify missing or weak skills.\n3. Compare the candidate's experience with the job requirements.\n4. Identify relevant projects and qualifications.\n5. Calculate a reasonable match score from 0 to 100.\n6. Explain why the candidate received that score.\n7. Identify the candidate's strongest areas.\n8. Identify areas that need improvement.\n9. Give a clear recommendation.\n10. Suggest skills or topics the candidate should learn before applying/interviewing.\n\nDo not invent experience, education, certifications or skills that are not present in the candidate information.\n\nDo not make decisions based on protected characteristics or personal attributes.\n\nFocus only on job-related qualifications, skills, experience and requirements."
        }
      },
